  <div class="subs-item">
    <h3>Engaging Clients Beyond the Scope</h3>
    <p>Business development doesn’t stop at the contract. Inviting clients into project reviews, sharing insights, and highlighting innovations turns delivery into relationship-building, positioning your team as a trusted advisor for future opportunities.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="subs-item">
    <h3>Showcasing Success Strategically</h3>
    <p>A finished project should feed proposals, presentations, and industry recognition. With thoughtful packaging—photos, data, stories—your project becomes proof of expertise, fueling future pursuits and setting your firm apart in competitive markets.</p>
